	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#35FCF9 to=#BFFFFD f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>基岩之下有东西</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>原版游戏给了深暗一个生物、一个结构，却没有理由让你回去。 </grad><grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>Deeper and Darker</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 则完成了这项工作。它为世界增添了完整的第二层，一个名为 </grad><grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>Otherside</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的维度，位于基岩之下，通过杀死那里唯一能杀死你的生物即可抵达……</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 本章所有内容均从模组文件和该整合包自身配置中测量得出。若整合包修改了数值，则以整合包中的数值为准。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#2FD9D6 to=#A8F4F2 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>本章内容概述</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>坚守者、它的两种掉落物，以及一具尸体如何变成一扇门。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>另一个世界本身。四个生物群系，独特的矿物表，而且床在那里也能用。"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>远古神殿</grad></shadow><grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>，该模组唯一建造的建筑物，也是里面唯一值得偷的两种东西。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两种齿轮等级。 </grad></shadow><grad from=#7CF5C0 to=#2FD98A f=0.8>共鸣器</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>隐藏了一个几乎无人注意到的防御技巧，而且 </grad></shadow><grad from=#9DB8D4 to=#5D7791 f=0.8>坚守者</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>齿轮完全碾压下界合金。"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>底部有个生物图鉴，因为其中两种生物活着的价值远高于死去的。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 在靠近尖叫者之前，先阅读名为 `Vibrations` 的任务。本章几乎所有的死亡都源于噪音，而非伤害。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>潜行者能听见你。它看不见你，闻不见你，但它能听见你。下面的一切都源于这句话。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "deeperdarker:heart_of_the_deep"
			id: "19D7DDEA580BBD3A"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
				id: "04E874CE67913776"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 100
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#5FD8D6 to=#5FD8D6>地板从来都不是底部</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				biome: "minecraft:deep_dark"
				icon: "minecraft:sculk_shrieker"
				id: "1EB17C5F502ABBB2"
				title: "&b深层黑暗"
				type: "biome"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#35FCF9 to=#BFFFFD f=0.6>更深更暗</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["19D7DDEA580BBD3A"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#35FCF9 to=#BFFFFD f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>守门人</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>通往另一面的传送门，没有 </grad></shadow><grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>深海之心</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>就无法点燃，而唯一能携带它的，是一具死去的 </grad></shadow><grad from=#9DB8D4 to=#5D7791 f=0.8>坚守者</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的尸体。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>原版卫道士有 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>500</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 生命值和 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>0</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 护甲。本整合包不包含原版卫道士。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#2FD9D6 to=#A8F4F2 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>你真正要对抗的敌人</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>700</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>基础生命值，并且</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>20</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>护甲值，而原版则没有。"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>近战伤害提高至 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>5</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，击退强度提高至 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1.4</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，会将你击退很远。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它会在 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>L2Hostility 等级 140 以上生成，</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>最低。生命值和伤害在上述数值的基础上缩放，而非取而代之。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一级保证特性：</grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>坦克</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>迟缓</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>恶心</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>失明</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>反击</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>自适应</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和</grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>加速</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它的饰品栏里带着一枚 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>Stygian Safety Talisman</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。那可是件稀罕物，掉落的话就是你的了。"
				""
				"[!danger] `Counter Strike`会反弹伤害，而`Adaptive`会针对你持续使用的伤害类型产生抗性。只使用一种武器是这里最糟糕的做法。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#2FD9D6 to=#A8F4F2 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>两颗露珠</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两者都来自战利品修饰器，而非卫道士的战利品表，所以整合包中没有任何东西能悄悄删除它们。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>深海之心</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会掉落</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>一次</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每次必定掉落，无需随机判定。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>潜袭者甲壳</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>掉落物：</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1至3个</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每次击杀。甲壳是整个潜袭者装备树的起点。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 远古城市的宝箱还有 `20%` 的概率掉落甲壳和 `45%` 的概率掉落卫道士升级模板。先搜刮城市意味着你只需击败卫道士一次。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>在本模组中，坚守者被视为潜声生物，因此潜声重击对其有效，且它永远不会攻击其他潜声生物。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon_scale: 1.2d
			id: "51EEA50609DFF126"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "052B8DE8C74C5285"
					item: "deeperdarker:warden_carapace"
					random_bonus: 1
					type: "item"
