		{
			dependencies: ["45FB2B89D2DF1138"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#35FCF9 to=#BFFFFD f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>共鸣器工具</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"Smithing table, an iron tool plus a Resonarium Plate, and no template at all. The template slot has to be left empty or the recipe will not appear."
				""
				"[!info] 跳过铁直接升到钻石级，中间完全碰不到钻石，这正是这条分支的意义所在。污泥是唯一成本。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#2FD9D6 to=#A8F4F2 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>等级，已测定</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>挖掘等级 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>3</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，与钻石相同。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>挖掘速度 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>8.0</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和伤害加成 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>3.0</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，再次与钻石完全相同。"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>耐久度 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1193</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 钻石的 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1561</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。这是它唯一输的地方。"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>附魔等级 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>15</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 钻石的 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>10</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。附魔台更容易出好结果。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>修复材料是共振器，可在繁茂洞穴的污泥中掉落。一旦你建好污泥农场，耐久度就不再重要了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 该整合包将剑归类于 `forge:iron_tools`，其余套装则归类于 `forge:diamond_tools`，因此剑比镐子更早解锁整个首领系列。"
			]
