		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1C89B122F8DF31FA"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#35FCF9 to=#BFFFFD f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>卫道士盔甲</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>下界合金盔甲，外加一个 </grad></shadow><grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>强化回响碎片</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和 </grad></shadow><grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>卫道士升级模板</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，一件一件来。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>基础材质：</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>24</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 对下界合金的防御力：</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>20</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，韧性：</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>4.0</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，抗破坏性：</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>3.0</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，附魔等级：</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>18</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，且每个部位的耐久度倍率更高。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#2FD9D6 to=#A8F4F2 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>各部件的实际作用</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- 佩戴头盔的每刻，都会移除<c1><grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>失明</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>黑暗效果</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。这几乎能克制卫道士。该整合包还增加了<c2><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+1</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>护甲，</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+2</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>生命值，</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+10%移动速度，以及+3%攻击伤害和速度。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>胸甲</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。该整合包增加了 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+3</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 生命值， </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+10% 的 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+3% 的 </grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 移动速度， </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+0.05 的 </grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 攻击伤害和速度，以及击退抗性。"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>护腿</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。平坦的 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+0.05</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 移动速度。你的基础速度是 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>0.1</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，所以一件就能提升 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>50 百分比</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的冲刺速度。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>靴子</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。安静的靴子。它们带有 </grad></shadow><grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>减震</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 标签。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#2FD9D6 to=#A8F4F2 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>关于那双靴子</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>穿上守夜者靴子会消除你的 </grad></shadow><grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>脚步、</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> </grad></shadow><grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>落地、</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> </grad></shadow><grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>游泳、</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad></shadow><grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>溅起水花、</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的震动。潜声传感器、尖啸器和守夜者将完全听不到你的移动声。"
				""
				"[!success] 所有说“卫道士靴子没用”的说法都过时了。对于打算穿越深暗而不是硬闯的人来说，它们是整套装备中最有用的单品。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>该材质的每件装备提供0.1的击退抗性，全套共0.4，再加上头盔和胸甲的额外0.05。</grad></shadow>"
			]
