		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7BA06C91408097F3"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#35FCF9 to=#BFFFFD f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>灵魂鞘翅</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个工作台，一个 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>鞘翅</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>， </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>4个</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 潜声骨， </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2个</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 灵魂水晶和 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2个</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 灵魂粉尘。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#2FD9D6 to=#A8F4F2 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>有哪些变化</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在胸部盔甲槽位提供 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+3</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>点护甲。普通鞘翅不提供护甲。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>耐久度 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>956</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 原版鞘翅的耐久度为 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>432</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，所以是两倍多。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>按下默认绑定的 </grad></shadow><grad from=#35FCF9 to=#12B7C4 f=0.8>B 键，</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>即可进行火箭自由冲刺。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>加速冷却时间是 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>600 ticks</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，即 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>30 seconds</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，并且是本整合包中的一个配置值。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 剩余冷却时间在佩戴时会显示在动作栏上，所以你永远不必猜测。"
				""
				"[!tip] 用 `Soul Crystal` 在砧上修复。幻影膜对这个没用。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>它本质上仍然是鞘翅，所以“不损坏”和“修补”的效果完全符合你的预期。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "3625A4D55155720F"
			min_width: 330
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "7763F9E2218C951D"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 100
				}
				{
					id: "778D5D99EA93DC37"
